@meeting introBunk
// The arrival evening, step A7 (plans/pillar4-plan.md Part 1): Torres shows you Bunk 1 and hands you your device.
// Tomas may be there (Sunday evening). The head writer's lines, replacing section 21's stand-in. You're berth 4,
// the upper bunk above Zofia Santos's; Tomas is berth 1, by the door, under his star map. Tomas's three lines are a
// self-contained aside (section 21 leaves them out when he isn't in the room): nothing after them depends on them.
title: Your bunk
from: Zeke Torres
gist: Torres showed you Bunk 1 and your wardrobe, and handed you your device. He sent you a Mail on it.
== lines
torres-zeke > you: Bunk 1. This is you. This is where you sleep.   [gesture]
torres-zeke: The top bunk in the middle is yours.
torres-zeke > you: Bag in your wardrobe. Go on, it's yours now.
tomas: Oh! You're here! Hi. I'm Tomas. Watch. Bottom bunk, by the door.
tomas > you: I only got here last Sunday. So I'm not the newest any more. Sorry. I'm very pleased about that.
tomas: I'll show you the washroom in the morning. It's left at the end. It's left. It's probably left.
torres-zeke > you: And this is yours. Your device.   [gesture]
torres-zeke: I've sent you a Mail on it. Open it when you've a minute. The rest is in there.
? choice
* What do I do first?   rel:torres-zeke+1 flavour:practical
  torres-zeke: Dinner. Always dinner first. Then everything else.   [nod]
* Is it always this much?   rel:torres-zeke+1 flavour:share
  torres-zeke: First night, yes. By Thursday it's just home with a lift in it.   [nod]
* (Just nod)
  torres-zeke: Good. The quiet ones last longest.
torres-zeke: Right, onward. The mess is on Deck 3, and Brennan doesn't hold plates for anyone.   [gesture]
